        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Benton%2C_Montana",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fort Benton's waterfront was designated the Fort Benton Historic District, a National Historic Landmark, in 1961.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
